# Mimari / Architecture

- Keep the process boundaries in [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md).
- UI talks to the platform only through GraphQL. No ad-hoc REST except health checks.
- The desktop runner, MCP host, and generated-project folder live on the user machine.
- Platform state lives in MongoDB. Generated app source lives on disk, not as a substitute for MongoDB.
- Do not add a third LLM without updating LLMOps docs and the router.
- Do not add a cloud for customer APIs without an explicit product decision (currently forbidden).
